wildos-remote (0.1.8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The terminal copies text as soon as you select it, and right-click
    opens Copy, Paste and Clear. Ctrl+V pastes, Ctrl+Shift+C copies,
    Ctrl+= and Ctrl+- change the text size (Ctrl+0 resets it), and the
    cursor blinks, as in Terminal. Ctrl+C still stops the running command.

